  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。滿載愛心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Enchanting Commands 是一個極簡模組，允許玩家透過指令輕鬆製作附魔等級超過預設上限的附魔物品。可與其他新增自訂附魔的模組相容。輸入指令時可按下 Tab 鍵進行自動補全。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的便利性模組包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enchantCommandString</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 \"ec\"<br>使用此模組功能的預設指令。預設為 /ec。若與其他模組衝突可進行修改。<br><br></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"實機畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong><em>/ec 指令的基本用法。</em></strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/a.png\" alt=\"ec\" width=\"752\" height=\"178\"><br><br><span><em><strong>附魔列表（1.16 版本）。</strong></em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"215\"><br><br><em><strong>可與其他模組的附魔相容：</strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"422\"><br><br><strong>將附魔套用至主手物品上。</strong></em><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/d.png\" alt=\"ecsharp\" width=\"731\" height=\"134\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/e.png\" alt=\"ecsharpsword\" width=\"425\" height=\"178\"><br><br><span><em><strong>附魔也可套用至「非工具類」物品上。</strong></em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/f.png\" alt=\"ecknockback\" width=\"670\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/g.png\" alt=\"ecknockbackstick\" width=\"414\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您即可在任何模組包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
